repository-code: "https://github.com/Urielledezma/Analisis-de-Riesgo"
url: "https://urielledezma.github.io/Analisis-de-Riesgo/"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end market risk research framework in R, applied to Grupo
  Aeroportuario del Pacífico and to a six-asset Mexican equity portfolio.
  Covers issuer characterisation, price-path and event attribution, return
  distribution testing and geometric Brownian motion projection, conditional
  variance models (moving average, EWMA, data-driven EWMA and ARCH/GARCH), and
  portfolio Value at Risk and Expected Shortfall with backtesting and
  minimum-VaR optimisation. The analytics are configuration-driven and reusable
  against any equity universe.
keywords:
  - market risk
  - value at risk
  - expected shortfall
  - conditional volatility
  - GARCH
  - geometric Brownian motion
  - emerging markets
  - Bolsa Mexicana de Valores
  - R
